#
#   ZERO           1  no width of its own: Cc, Mn, Me, Cf (but the prepended concatenation marks), Default_Ignorable_Code_Point
#   WIDE           2  East_Asian_Width W or F
#   EMOJI          4  Emoji
#   EPRES          8  Emoji_Presentation, in the BMP
#   PICT          16  Extended_Pictographic
#   EMOD          32  Emoji_Modifier
#   EMODBASE      64  Emoji_Modifier_Base
#   RI           128  Regional_Indicator
#   HANGUL       256  a Hangul syllable or a leading or vowel jamo: what a vowel or trailing jamo joins
#   HVT          512  a Hangul vowel or trailing jamo
#
